lean_claims.plain:
All fields of the structure hold, including:
- inf_f (f(0)/f̂(0))^{1/d}/√d → 1/π;
- log₂ LP_d / d → −(1/2)·log₂(2π/e);
- α* = (1/2)·log₂(2π/e) ∈ (0.604400544291677695341677307053, …054);
- eventually every admissible f has f(0)/f̂(0) ≥ 2^d/v_d · (√(e/2π) − δ_d)^d, with δ_d ≥ 0 and δ_d → 0.
